// Google Sign-In on iOS (google_sign_in). Info.plist reads both values from here as
// GIDClientID and as the app's callback URL scheme; with them empty, iOS sign-in fails with
// "No active configuration".
//
// Where they come from: Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials, in the same
// project as the web client 87789110323-...apps.googleusercontent.com that auth_provider.dart
// passes as serverClientId -> Create credentials -> OAuth client ID -> iOS, bundle ID
// com.auraai.auraClient. The client ID and its "iOS URL scheme" are on that client's page.
// Neither is a secret: both ship inside the app binary.
//
//   GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID          = 123456789012-abc123.apps.googleusercontent.com
//   GOOGLE_IOS_REVERSED_CLIENT_ID = com.googleusercontent.apps.123456789012-abc123
//
// test/ios_release_config_test.dart checks the two agree once they are set.
GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID =
GOOGLE_IOS_REVERSED_CLIENT_ID =
